      "title": "El cacique Guatavita y la leyenda de El Dorado — Juan Rodríguez Freyle excerpt",
      "source_type": "primary_document",
      "creator": "Juan Rodríguez Freyle",
      "date": "1636 textual horizon; institutional later transcription/edition",
      "language": "Spanish",
      "locator": "https://babel.banrepcultural.org/digital/api/collection/p17054coll3/id/52/download",
      "provenance": "Banco de la República digital collection reproducing Freyle's El Carnero passage on Guatavita and El Dorado.",
      "quality": "primary",
      "notes": [
        "Freyle states that don Juan, cacique and lord of Guatavita, told him the relevant antiquities/traditions.",
        "This is evidence for Freyle's recorded version and claimed informant chain, not direct archaeological proof of the pre-contact ceremony."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-SH-COL-MUISCA-RAFT-2021",
      "title": "The Muisca Raft: Context, Materiality and Technology",
      "source_type": "scholarly_work",
